          "text": "icer of the Borrower, dated the Extension Date, stating that: (x) the representations and warranties contained in Section 4.01 are true and correct in all material respects on and as of the Extension Date, (y) no Default has occurred and is continuing or would result from such extension and (z) the Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio is greater than 1.15:1.00, (b) the Administrative Agent shall have received payment by the B"
